{"id":"660541","name":"黄花菜木耳炒肉","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/660541/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄花菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"适量"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"芹菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黄花菜提前泡发备用。","img":"images/660541/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"适量木耳泡发备用。","img":"images/660541/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"瘦肉洗净切片。","img":"images/660541/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量玉米淀粉，生抽，蚝油，老抽抓匀腌制备用。","img":"images/660541/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"芹菜洗净切段备用。","img":"images/660541/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中热油放入瘦肉翻炒。","img":"images/660541/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入黄花菜，大火翻炒均匀。","img":"images/660541/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入木耳炒匀。","img":"images/660541/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"少许盐调味。","img":"images/660541/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入适量清水，焖一分钟左右。","img":"images/660541/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入芹菜段，翻炒均匀至断生即可。","img":"images/660541/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660541/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660541/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660541/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}